# ── SMTP ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# One transport for every email the app sends (src/utils/mailer.js). Set these
# to move provider without touching code.
#
# SMTP_SECURE is derived from the port when left unset: true on 465 (implicit
# TLS), false on 587 (STARTTLS). Setting it true on 587 makes the connection
# hang until it times out.
#
# SMTP_USER/SMTP_PASSWORD fall back to EMAIL/EMAIL_PASSWORD below, so a
# deployment that predates this block keeps working on Gmail unchanged.
#
# Titan (what rivermossbooks.com uses):
#   SMTP_HOST=smtp.titan.email
#   SMTP_PORT=465
#   SMTP_SECURE=true
