# The JWT secret actually in effect — see the dead duplicate above.
# Used by src/passwordhash/password.js as the HMAC key for password hashing.
# IMPORTANT: dotenv truncates any unquoted value at its first "#" — the
# runtime value is actually just "MySuperSecret@Key", not the full string
# below. Every existing user's password hash was computed against that
# truncated value. Do NOT "fix" this by quoting it (or changing this value at
# all) without a plan for existing accounts — the moment the effective value
# changes, every current user's stored password hash stops matching and they
# are locked out until they reset their password.
